@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title HD — conditional handoff position
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Populated selected inputs\n03, 05–10 models/contracts; 12 interfaces; 13 scenarios\nSource hashes identify current working package" as Models
rectangle "Remaining analysis specificity\n04 functions/DFDs; exact criterion/path/policy reconciliation\n15 has no observed current-process study" as Remaining #FFF3DF
rectangle "Qualified design input package\nAccepted core + marked proposals + scoped gates" as Package #DFF1EA
rectangle "Later actual coherent design/baseline review\nRequired decisions/evidence/conditions identified" as Review
Models --> Package : useful current input
Remaining --> Package : limits whole-phase completion
Package --> Review : no automatic acceptance
note bottom of Review
This file does not create final architecture or product code.
Incomplete whole-phase acceptance does not force a folder restart.
end note

legend bottom
Qualified analysis/design input, not a selected architecture, accepted forecast or operational proof.
No coding, provider/host operation, live tracker update, spending or baseline acceptance performed.
endlegend
@enduml
